Third-party code
================

This project builds on the Next-Concept Model (NCM) code from
https://github.com/HazyResearch/ncm, released under the MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2025 hermann kumbong.

The upstream repository itself is not included and must be obtained separately
(see third_party/README.md). Two files here, tokenizer/quantizer.py and
tokenizer/codifica64.py, contain code adapted from upstream models/quant.py;
they are marked at the top, and the upstream licence text is reproduced in
third_party/NCM_LICENSE.
